
<body class="bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark font-display text-[#111318]">
<div class="relative flex min-h-screen w-full flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 hand-drawn-bg">
<!-- Header Section -->
<div class="w-full max-w-md flex items-center mb-8 justify-center">
<div class="relative">
<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter transform -rotate-2 px-4 py-2">
                    あそびかた
                </h1>
<div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-full sketch-line opacity-40"></div>
</div>
 <!-- Spacer for centering -->
</div>
<div class="w-full max-w-md space-y-6">
<!-- Rule 1: Basics -->
<div class="hand-drawn-border p-5 bg-white shadow-sm transform rotate-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary font-bold">grid_on</span>
<h2 class="text-xl font-bold">1. 基本ルール</h2>
</div>
<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    1から25の数字が並んだ5x5の盤面で戦うよ。<span class="marker-highlight font-bold">真ん中のFREEマスはないよ！</span>
</p>
<div class="w-full aspect-video bg-gray-50 rounded-lg border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden relative" data-alt="Sketch of a 5x5 bingo grid with numbers 1 to 25">
<div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1 opacity-40">
<div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div>
<div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div>
<div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-red-500">X</div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div>
<div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div>
<div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div><div class="size-6 border border-black"></div>
</div>
<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center rotate-12">
<div class="bg-white/80 px-4 py-1 border-2 border-red-500 text-red-500 font-bold rounded-full">NO FREE!</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Rule 2: Declaration -->
<div class="hand-drawn-border p-5 bg-white shadow-sm transform -rotate-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary font-bold">record_voice_over</span>
<h2 class="text-xl font-bold">2. 数字の宣言</h2>
</div>
<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    交互に好きな数字を1つずつ選ぶよ。相手の盤面も考えて慎重に！
                </p>
<div class="mt-4 flex justify-around items-center">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">face</span>
<div class="w-12 h-1 bg-gray-200 rounded-full"></div>
</div>
<div class="text-2xl font-black text-primary animate-pulse">「15！」</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">face_5</span>
<div class="w-12 h-1 bg-gray-200 rounded-full"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Rule 3: Ojama Rule -->
<div class="hand-drawn-border p-5 bg-primary/5 shadow-md border-primary border-[4px]">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary font-bold">warning</span>
<h2 class="text-xl font-bold">3. お邪魔ルール <span class="text-xs text-primary">(ここが大事!)</span></h2>
</div>
<ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<div class="size-6 rounded-full bg-primary flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">自</div>
<div>
<p class="font-bold underline decoration-primary decoration-2">自分が言った数字：</p>
<p>自分の盤面が埋まる（<span class="text-primary font-bold">攻め！</span>）</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<div class="size-6 rounded-full bg-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">他</div>
<div>
<p class="font-bold underline decoration-gray-400 decoration-2">相手が言った数字：</p>
<p>自分の盤面が「<span class="text-red-500 font-bold">お邪魔マーク(X)</span>」になる。</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<div class="mt-4 bg-red-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-red-200 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold text-center">
                    ※お邪魔マークは消せないから注意！
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Rule 4: Victory -->
<div class="hand-drawn-border p-5 bg-white shadow-sm transform rotate-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-yellow-500 font-bold">emoji_events</span>
<h2 class="text-xl font-bold">4. 勝利条件</h2>
</div>
<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    縦・横・斜めのどれか1ラインが先に揃った方の勝ち！
                </p>
<div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
<div class="relative p-2 border border-gray-200 rounded">
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 opacity-30">
<div class="size-4 bg-black"></div><div class="size-4 bg-black"></div><div class="size-4 bg-black"></div>
<div class="size-4 border border-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div>
<div class="size-4 border border-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div>
</div>
<div class="absolute top-4 left-0 w-full h-0.5 bg-primary -rotate-3"></div>
</div>
<div class="relative p-2 border border-gray-200 rounded">
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 opacity-30">
<div class="size-4 bg-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div>
<div class="size-4 bg-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div>
<div class="size-4 bg-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div><div class="size-4 border border-black"></div>
</div>
<div class="absolute top-0 left-4 h-full w-0.5 bg-primary rotate-3"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- OK Button -->
<div class="pt-6 pb-10">
<%=link_to root_path, class: "block w-full py-4 text-2xl font-black bg-primary text-white hand-drawn-border border-primary shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(17,82,212,0.3)] hover:translate-y-1 hover:shadow-none transition-all duration-75 text-center" do %>
                    OK！わかった
                <% end %>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Navigation Bar Mock -->
</div>
</body>